WEBVTT

00:11:28.875 --> 00:11:32.167
And the how was harmony,

00:11:32.167 --> 00:11:35.458
stacking up the pitches to form chords.

00:11:35.458 --> 00:11:37.208
And the chords, it turned out,

00:11:37.208 --> 00:11:41.292
were capable of representing incredible varieties of emotions.

00:11:41.292 --> 00:11:46.091
And the basic chords were the ones we still have with us,

00:11:46.091 --> 00:11:47.352
the triads,

00:11:47.352 --> 00:11:50.611
either the major one,

00:11:50.611 --> 00:11:55.219
which we think is happy,

00:11:55.219 --> 00:11:58.564
or the minor one,

00:11:58.564 --> 00:12:02.500
which we perceive as sad.